 "text": "Skip to main content\n\nCall Us\n\n \nEnglish\n \n \n \n \nLogin\n \nRegister\nHome\nIndividual/HUF\n»\nCompany\n»\nNon-Company\n»\nTax Professionals & Others\n»\nDownloads\nHelp\nContact Us \nContact Us\nContact Us\nHelp Desk Contact Details\ne-filing and Centralized Processing Center\n\ne-Filing of Income Tax Return or Forms and other value added services & Intimation, Rectification, Refund and other Income Tax Processing Related Queries.\n\n08:00 hrs - 20:00  hrs (Monday to Friday)\n\n1800 103 0025\n\n \n\n1800 419 0025\n\n+91-80-46122000\n\n \n\n+91-80-61464700\n\nAIS and Reporting Portal\n\nQueries related to AIS, TIS, SFT Preliminary response, Response to e-campaigns or e-Verification\n\n09:30 hrs - 18:00 hrs (Monday to Friday)\n\nThe path for logging AIS related grievances is \"Efiling--> AIS tab--> this will navigate to AIS Portal--> Help menu --> Raise/View Ticket Status\n\n1800 103 4215\n\nTDS Reconciliation Analysis and Correction Enabling System (TRACES)\n\nForm 16, Tax Credit (Form 26AS) and other queries related to TDS statement, Form 15CA processing.\n\n10:00 hrs - 18:00 hrs (Monday to Saturday)\n\n1800 103 0344\n\n+91-120-4814600\n\nTax Information Network - NSDL\n\nQueries related to PAN & TAN application for Issuance / Update through NSDL\n\n07:00 hrs - 23:00 hrs (All Days)\n\n+91-20-27218080\n\nDemand Management - Tax Payer Demand Facilitation Center\n\nFacilitation for resolution of Outstanding tax demand\n\nTimings of DFC for receiving Inbound calls from Taxpayers - \n\n08:00 hrs - 20:00 hrs (Monday to Friday), 09:00 hrs - 18:00 hrs (Saturday) – Except National Holidays\n\nTimings of DFC making outbound calls to Taxpayers -\n\n10:00 hrs - 18:00 hrs (Monday to Friday)\n\nEmail: taxdemand@cpc.incometax.gov.in\n\nInbound number (Taxpayers  can  call  the  toll-free  number  below)\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n1800 309 0130\n+91 821 6671200\n+91 821-7151515\n\n \n\nOutbound Numbers (Taxpayers will receive calls from Demand Facilitation Centre from numbers below)\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n+91 8216671200\n+91 821-7151515\n\nWeb Manager\ne-Filing Unit, Centralized Processing Centre, Income Tax Department, Bengaluru 560500.\nQueries related to\tEmail id\nTax Audit report (Form 3CA-3CD, 3CB-3CD)\tTAR.helpdesk@incometax.gov.in\nIncome Tax return (For ITR 1 to ITR 7)\tITR.helpdesk@incometax.gov.in\ne-Pay Tax service\tepay.helpdesk@incometax.gov.in\nAny other issue\tefilingwebmanager@incometax.gov.in\n\nFollow us on\n\n    \n\nAbout Us\nAbout the Portal\nHistory of Direct Taxation\nVision, Mission, Values\nVision, Mission, Values (Hindi)\nWho We Are\nRight to Information\nOrganization & Functions\ne-Filing Calendar 2026\nTax Payer Charter\nTax Payer Charter (Hindi)\n\t\nContact Us\nHelpdesk Numbers\nGrievances\nView Grievance\nHelp\n\t\nUsing the Portal\nWebsite Policies\nAccessibility Statement\nSite Map\nBrowser Support\n\t\nRelated Sites\nIncome Tax India\nProtean (previously NSDL)\nTRACES\n\nLast reviewed and updated on : 17-Oct-2026\n\nThis site is best viewed in 1024 * 768 resolution with latest version of Chrome, Firefox, Safari and Internet Explorer.\n\nCopyright @ Income Tax Department, Ministry of Finance, Government of India. All Rights Reserved.",
